  {
    "id": "example-home-theatre-equipment-home-theatre-equipment-example",
    "type": "comment",
    "name": "Home theatre equipment example",
    "info": "Each equipment controller accepts a generation-scoped intent and reports target state. Output 1 carries commands for your device transport; output 2 carries theatre target state.\n\nThe display controller talks to the TV, screen and projector relay directly: set their hosts and the TV pre-shared key before deploying. Until then it shows \"invalid configuration\".",
